{"title": "同一个 Nginx：没配的 403，配了的是文件列表", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" localhost/plain/"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "403"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost/files/"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "<h1>Index of /files/</h1><hr><pre><a href=\"../\">../</a>"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "<a href=\"big-archive.tar\">big-archive.tar</a>  14-Sep-2026 00:27  1M"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "<a href=\"readme.txt\">readme.txt</a>           14-Sep-2026 00:27   15"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "exact_size off 让 tar 显示 1M，localtime on 显示本地时间"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:1.28-alpine 容器（nginx/1.28.3）"}
]}
